      "content": "I'm really sorry you're experiencing such overwhelming feelings. Grief can often make everything seem meaningless, and the feeling of emptiness you describe is a profound loss that affects so much more than just sadness. Time can indeed help heal, but it's a gradual process and absolutely takes courage to continue moving forward when it all feels so heavy. Sharing what you're going through with close friends, family, or a professional can bring some support during this difficult time. It might also be helpful to consider small, achievable goals each day, to gently realign with the idea that meaning can be rebuilt over time.",
