    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know if i have the courage for that. honestly i feel like i'm just going through the motions. like i'm just a ghost in this house waiting for something to happen. it's just so exhausting to keep trying to find \"meaning\" in things that don't matter anymore. sometimes i just think... if the best part of life is already over, what's the point of staying for the rest of it?",
